@startuml search-sequence
!include _style.puml
title Search Available Tutors - Gateway Composition
autonumber
actor Student
participant "React Web" as Web
participant "Gateway BFF" as GW
participant "Tutor Service" as Tutor
participant "Scheduling Service" as Scheduling

Student -> Web : chọn subject + date + timezone
Web -> GW : GET /api/v1/search/available-tutors
GW -> GW : validate JWT/query, UTC day bounds
GW -> Tutor : GET tutor candidates (paged)
Tutor --> GW : profiles + subjects + availability
GW -> Scheduling : POST /internal/v1/slots/query\n<=100 tutorIds, <=7 days
Scheduling --> GW : available slots grouped by tutorId
GW -> GW : join by tutorId, preserve pagination
GW --> Web : 200 results + generatedAtUtc
Web --> Student : hiển thị snapshot

note over GW,Scheduling
Không N+1. Nếu dependency lỗi, trả 503; không giả danh sách trống.
Kết quả search không thay thế bước tạo hold.
end note
@enduml

